minds.

00:01:45.119 --> 00:01:49.729
If you think there's some way to fix these
folks brains, let me know.

00:01:49.729 --> 00:01:55.240
But I think it's much simpler to register
people to vote and to cancel out their votes.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.450
Next message is from Kara.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:03.400
Kara wrote it and said, Your F-ing Nazi baiter,
boy.

