00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.850
Who the f are you?

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.230
Well, if you don't even know who I am.

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:34.440
Why is it important that hundreds and millions,
hundreds of millions of Trump is silence me?

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:38.830
If I'm so insignificant that Kara has not
heard of me, I don't know why anyone would

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.860
need to waste any time silencing me.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:48.450
By the way, it's really interesting how the
delusions seem to spread virally.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:53.760
And what I mean by that is recently Trump
pulled this idea that there's hundreds of

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.840
millions of MAGA people at his last rally.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:02.430
Trump said something like, Oh, there were
the 75 million who voted for me, plus another

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:05.620
150 million, probably like so.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:11.470
So Trump believes that there's 225 million
Trumpists in the United States.

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:14.200
Now, correct me if I'm wrong.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.460
Number of adults in USA 2022.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:21.100
What are the number of adults?

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.280
I actually can't find that.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.820
Anyway, the point is 225 million maggots.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:29.370
It's like it's got to be close to every adult.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:34.060
I don't know what percentage of the population
is under 18, but it's got to be 20% or more.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:39.000
Anyway, as usual, as is the case with these
people, the numbers never add up.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.140
The numbers never add up.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:41.140
Thank you, Carol.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.140
I appreciate that.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.140
Okay.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.780
Mike wrote in again asking about these spam
messages that he's getting.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.100
Mike says, I've received this message a couple
of times in response to comments made on Dave

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:53.090
Pacman YouTube clips.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.640
Question is scam or legit?

00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:00.550
I don't use WhatsApp, but I am curious and
it's one of these messages where the user

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:06.540
has my picture as their profile picture and
it says Write me.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:09.410
I know that this is a disappointment to some
in the audience.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.510
Some people will write to me and say, David,
I was so excited that you wanted to hear more

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:17.060
from me about my view on, you know, Hillary
Clinton or whatever that I tried writing you

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.630
on WhatsApp like you told me.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:27.030
I am not asking anyone to text me or to WhatsApp
me or anything.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.290
These are scammers.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.060
Report them to YouTube.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.900
We are doing everything we can to get this
scourge.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:37.080
As Trump would like to say off of YouTube.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.990
As far as I know, no one's been scammed so
far, but eventually they will ask you for

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:41.990
money.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:42.990
That's the scam.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:45.600
And at some point I'll do an expose, a bigger
picture on the full scam.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.600
But no, I'm not.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:47.600
What?

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.600
Zapping anybody.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.600
I'm not texting anybody.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.660
I don't want you to text or WhatsApp me.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.030
It is a scam.

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:53.380
Do not fall for it.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:05:00.840
Jada noticed an anomaly on our Social Blade
page, which tracks our YouTube channel.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:05.810
Jaden said, David, Sir, I was looking at the
social blade for your YouTube channel and

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:10.380
I noticed that as a graph of your subscriber
increases.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:15.290
I have tears in my eyes as I tell you that
it appears that the machines have been dumping

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.560
new subscribers of 10,000 every couple of
weeks.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:22.180
There are huge gaps and irregularities that
cannot be explained.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:27.500
Please, sir, we need pillow on the show so
he can explain how the machines did this.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:31.460
You know, a few people have written to me
and they said, David, is there a scam going

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:32.950
on with your subscribers?

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:37.330
Because you get none for days and then suddenly
10,001 day.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.650
Let me explain on YouTube.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:46.640
Once you get to a million subscribers, the
algorithm shifts into tracking them in tens

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:47.640
of thousands.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:54.230
So like when you look at our YouTube channel,
it'll say 1.47 million subscribers and then

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.590
it'll go to 1.48.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:00.660
So it tracks them in 10,000 increments.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.980
When that is the case, Social Blade does the
same thing.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:11.600
So in reality we get like 600 subscribers
a day, but it only updates now every 10,000.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:16.980
No scam going on, check any channel above
a million subscribers and you will see it's

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.310
the same.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.310
Michael wrote it.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.870
Michael says, David, I sincerely want to thank
you for the public service you do in showing

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:24.520
the liars and hypocrites on your show.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:29.550
I think it's a very necessary, but I can't
bear to watch some of the outrageous clips

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:30.590
you show.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:37.090
So I mute the sound and just listen to your
commentary to learn what nonsense was said.

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:43.080
You must have a great deal of self-control
to be able to listen to Trump and the maggots

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.590
day in and day out.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.530
Well, I don't know if this is a good thing
or a bad thing.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.110
I've talked about this before.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:57.050
There is a desensitization that happens when
you do what I do, where because outrageous

00:06:57.050 --> 00:07:01.389
things happen so often, they start to seem
less outrageous.

00:07:01.389 --> 00:07:05.450
And that's why it's good, number one, to take
time away from this stuff.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.820
And number two, to talk to people from different
places.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:12.080
So when I talk to family of mine from other
countries or even when foreign callers call

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:18.169
in or when I read articles about American
politics from other countries, it's always

00:07:18.169 --> 00:07:22.360
good to have sort of your sensibilities reset
because it's nuts here.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:27.860
This MAGA right wing authoritarian wannabe
fascist movement that is written about here

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.669
by Michael.

00:07:29.669 --> 00:07:34.090
These people are genuinely dangerous, and
it's also not typical.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.860
It's really not typical, and it's good to
get that perspective from other countries.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:40.780
Daniel wrote in about Mike Pillow.

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:44.440
And says, David, do you really think it's
appropriate to have Mike Lindell on your show

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.320
