00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.139
Anyway, just a thought.

00:07:56.139 --> 00:07:57.169
Let me know what you think.

00:07:57.169 --> 00:08:01.950
Daniel from Indiana says, Don't have pillow
on because he's he's mentally ill.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.639
