00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:07.829
It's a losing direction to go in saying, okay,
make abortions illegal for Republicans because

00:10:07.829 --> 00:10:09.490
they want it to be.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:15.019
We're almost as bad in saying deny a legal
medical procedure to people.

00:10:15.019 --> 00:10:16.019
Right.

00:10:16.019 --> 00:10:18.930
And so, no, I don't think that that's a good
idea at all.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:23.240
Gabriela wrote in about Democrats, quote,
winning, and she makes a good point.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.600
Gabriela says, Hello, sir.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:29.029
My dad used to tell me when I would ask, who's
winning during any sports game?

00:10:29.029 --> 00:10:31.480
Well, no one wins until the end.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.279
They're only ahead for now.

00:10:33.279 --> 00:10:38.329
I thought this might be relevant to your recent
clip on Democrats leading across the country,

00:10:38.329 --> 00:10:40.589
albeit not by enough.

00:10:40.589 --> 00:10:46.130
They're ahead for now, but it's up to voters
to help them win.

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:48.029
100% correct.

00:10:48.029 --> 00:10:54.740
And this is why every time we look at 2022
polling numbers, Senate forecast, House forecast,

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:58.550
I always say this is where we are right now.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.509
