polls.

00:11:01.509 --> 00:11:03.749
Everyone must vote.

00:11:03.749 --> 00:11:05.399
Everyone must vote.

00:11:05.399 --> 00:11:07.639
And I hope that you will.

00:11:07.639 --> 00:11:10.179
And we're starting to get down to the wire.

00:11:10.179 --> 00:11:16.079
